{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00167",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 5.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.92,
      "end_seconds": 10.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.62,
      "end_seconds": 16.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.08,
      "end_seconds": 26.24,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Mainly I've been passing out once last week. That's why I came. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.51,
      "end_seconds": 29.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.44,
      "end_seconds": 42.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "Uh, it's been going on for one week. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.96,
      "end_seconds": 52.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "So, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.11,
      "end_seconds": 59.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I notice it more with standing for long. About a six out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.39,
      "end_seconds": 63.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Have you had a bump on your head after?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.49,
      "end_seconds": 65.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.27,
      "end_seconds": 70.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Has there been a bit of lightheadedness since then too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.96,
      "end_seconds": 76.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Yeah. Five days, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.39,
      "end_seconds": 78.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Has there been blurred vision beforehand too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.72,
      "end_seconds": 84.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Yes, for about a week. With blurred vision beforehand, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.96,
      "end_seconds": 91.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any shaking or jerking, chest pain or loss of bladder control?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.74,
      "end_seconds": 94.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.42,
      "end_seconds": 96.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "What about palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.49,
      "end_seconds": 99.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "No palpitations, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 100.87,
      "end_seconds": 105.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice palpitations. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.45,
      "end_seconds": 111.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.72,
      "end_seconds": 118.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.87,
      "end_seconds": 121.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.13,
      "end_seconds": 124.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.64,
      "end_seconds": 126.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.59,
      "end_seconds": 130.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.36,
      "end_seconds": 133.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.11,
      "end_seconds": 137.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.88,
      "end_seconds": 146.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning for my blood pressure. Pantoprazole. I take it 40 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 147.24,
      "end_seconds": 151.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 80 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.99,
      "end_seconds": 157.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.21,
      "end_seconds": 160.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.85,
      "end_seconds": 164.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.94,
      "end_seconds": 176.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.85,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.06,
      "end_seconds": 182.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.13,
      "end_seconds": 190.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.78,
      "end_seconds": 192.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.1,
      "end_seconds": 201.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux for nearly five years now. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.86,
      "end_seconds": 213.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.94,
      "text": "Go on. Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. Okay, acid reflux, that's already on your record. Good to know. Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.25,
      "end_seconds": 219.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 221.29,
      "end_seconds": 226.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. BP is 125 over 81, pulse 81, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.06,
      "end_seconds": 228.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.1,
      "end_seconds": 232.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.84,
      "end_seconds": 236.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Okay, now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.12,
      "end_seconds": 250.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "No murmurs on listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.24,
      "end_seconds": 255.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.93,
      "end_seconds": 274.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Your pulse is regular and there's a small bruise on the right side of the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.19,
      "end_seconds": 304.61,
      "duration_seconds": 24.42,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a simple faint, probably reflex-related at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be dehydration, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.56,
      "end_seconds": 314.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been passing out once last week for one week, and no loss of bladder control or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.59,
      "end_seconds": 317.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.93,
      "end_seconds": 322.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.35,
      "end_seconds": 334.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.43,
      "text": "I mean, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.33,
      "end_seconds": 349.56,
      "duration_seconds": 13.23,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an echocardiogram for syncope. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like to arrange a Holter monitor for syncope. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.13,
      "end_seconds": 351.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.64,
      "end_seconds": 358.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for syncope. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.83,
      "end_seconds": 360.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.67,
      "end_seconds": 382.27,
      "duration_seconds": 20.6,
      "text": "Drink enough water and avoid standing still for long stretches, and sit if you feel it coming. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.16,
      "end_seconds": 386.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.08,
      "end_seconds": 395.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you pass out again, especially with chest pain or palpitations. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.79,
      "end_seconds": 397.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.57,
      "end_seconds": 401.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Please come and see me in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.61,
      "end_seconds": 406.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.94,
      "end_seconds": 413.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.75,
      "end_seconds": 418.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.63,
      "end_seconds": 423.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.28,
      "end_seconds": 427.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.82,
      "end_seconds": 428.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}